## Testing

- Place tests next to the code they cover: `test/` at package root.
- Name test files `<source_file>_test.dart`.
- Prefer unit tests for domain/data; widget tests for UI.
- Test Cubits with `bloc_test`; dispatch **Commands** through `execute()`.
- Register test doubles in GetIt or pass mocks to Cubits; `getIt.reset()` after each test when using the locator.
- Add or update tests when changing behavior, not just when asked.
